# SHA-256 of /System/Library/DTDs/sdef.dtd as shipped on macOS 26.5
# (Darwin 25.5.0, captured 2026-05-14). The dtd_drift integration test
# compares this pinned digest against the live system DTD on every
# `cargo test` invocation on macOS; a mismatch fails the test loudly so a
# human reviews whether Apple's DTD changes require AST updates.
#
# Lines beginning with '#' are ignored. Exactly one non-comment line
# carrying the lowercase hex digest is expected.
